    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa mininga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīlage ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe, hamò na a banhū a bose gīkī, “Ī shilagīlo īshi walagīlile SEEBA gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Munhū ose ose ū mu Baisilaeli ūlū alī mu ng'hambī nūūlū hanze ya ng'hambī, hūna ūsīnza ng'ombe nūūlū ng'holo, nūūlū mbūli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ūbiza atayenhile kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla kwiza kwīfunya shakwinha kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūbalīlwa būhūbi kūlwa mininga, witaga mininga; shiigelile akomanyiwe wīnjiwe ū mu banhū bakwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū shiigelile gūje gīko kūlwa gīkī, ī mitugo ījo Baisilaeli balūsīnzīlaga kū matogolo, bayūjenha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA bamfunīja shakwinha. Shibigelile kūyūjenha kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla, biza bang'winha ngabīji jafunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA kūbiza shakwinha sha būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūgaseeseebela a mininga ha ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gūlī ha nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla; a masazu ūgapemba gūbiza shakwinha sha ng'waso gwawiza kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwikala būfunya shakwinha shabo kū magulyati ayo bagagīmbile kūbiza ma mulungu gabo. Ī shilagīlo shenīshi shilī sha būja na būja kūlwa nguno yabo, nī shibyalīlwe īsho shiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage gīkī, ‘Munhū ose ose ūyo ūfunya shakwinha sha kūpemva nūūlū shitambò, abize ūmò wa Baisilaeli, nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò nabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ūleka kūshenha kū nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla kwiza kūshifunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ū munhū ng'wenūyo shiigelile akomanyiwe wīnjiwe ū mu banhū bakwe.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Munhū ose ose ūlū ūlya mininga akūnipelanya; ūyo ūlya mininga, nene ng'wenekele nakūbiza ng'wilwisha wakwe ū ng'wenūyo, abize ūmò wa Baisilaeli nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò nabo, nakūnkomanya winge gete ū mu banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpanga wa shiseeng'wa būlī mu mininga, hūna lūūlū ū nene nang'winhile a mininga gatūmame ha ng'walīlo kūtūūla isangī kūlwa būpanga wing'we; a mininga hū gene ayo gakatūūlaga isangī kūlwa nguno ya būpanga wa munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nalībahūgūla a Baisilaeli, ‘Atizilonga nūūlū ūmò wing'we wa kūlya mininga, nūūlū akabiza ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò ning'we, atizūūlya mininga na hado yaya.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nīyo hangī nūūlū ose ose, abize ūmò wa Baisilaeli nūūlū ngeni ūyo akwikalaga hamò ning'we, ūlū ūja kūhīīga hūna ūbūlaga ndimu nūūlū noni īyo īzunīlījiwe kūlyiwa, shiigelile agasūlūlūkīje hasī a mininga gayo, ūgafukīīla na masalū; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno ū būpanga wa shiseeng'wa shose būlī mu mininga gasho. H'ī nguno yeene nalībawīla a Baisilaeli, “Yaya kūlya mininga ga shiseeng'wa shose shose, nguno ū būpanga wa shiseeng'wa shose na shose būlī mu mininga gasho; ū wa kūlya mininga shing'wigeleelilwe kūkomanyiwa na kwīnjiwa ū mu banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būlī munhū ose ose, abize myalīlwa mu sī ying'we nūūlū ngeni, ūlū ūlya nyama ya shikolo sha kūcha shoi shenekīlī, nūūlū sha kūbūlagwa mashiinū, akūfula ī shizwalo shakwe, ooga na kooga mu minzī. Akūbiza nsoso kūshisha līīmi līlibīle; hūna ū kwandīja henaho ūbiza ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūleka kūfula ī shizwalo shakwe nū kooga ū mīlī gwakwe, akūbalwa kūbiza nkenaagūji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
